WEBVTT

00:20.880 --> 00:26.860
If I was dreaming, how did I forget?

00:26.920 --> 00:30.690
It pulsed through me, frigid, shocked me

00:30.690 --> 00:32.330
Can I do, do?

00:33.000 --> 00:38.000
I want you next to me when I summon you

00:39.170 --> 00:43.000
Waiting close by, but you seem far off

00:43.010 --> 00:45.340
Na, na, na, knight

00:45.340 --> 00:48.510
The more beautiful the rose

00:48.510 --> 00:51.480
The more its thorns hurt

00:51.480 --> 00:54.750
Now that I'm strong

00:54.750 --> 00:59.750
My heart knows to protect that vow

01:00.760 --> 01:03.790
Let's meet in the dark of night

01:03.790 --> 01:06.860
Where you're waiting

01:06.860 --> 01:09.860
You'll worship the cruel Dark Queen

01:09.870 --> 01:13.030
Who's drunk with danger

01:13.040 --> 01:16.000
You shattered the glass sword

01:16.000 --> 01:18.970
You wielded without thinking

01:18.970 --> 01:21.910
Its shards glow in the night

01:21.910 --> 01:25.380
I lick your wounded fingers

01:43.500 --> 01:45.880
They're so cruel to me.

01:55.180 --> 01:57.710
Okay, take care of it, Hiro.

01:58.150 --> 02:01.790
They always send me off on errands.

02:02.720 --> 02:05.290
Huh? My body...

02:05.290 --> 02:07.100
It feels so heavy.

02:44.360 --> 02:45.560
Huga.

02:45.560 --> 02:46.430
Food
Gas
Water
Electricity
Plant

02:46.430 --> 02:49.530
300,000 yen for electricity last month.

02:50.200 --> 02:54.370
My, I must have used a lot!

02:55.570 --> 02:58.170
I need to conserve, conserve!

02:58.170 --> 03:00.480
It's not your fault, Sawawa.

03:01.210 --> 03:06.080
We have a servant who uses an
incredible amount of energy.

03:06.080 --> 03:08.350
Isn't that right, Flandre?

03:08.350 --> 03:09.420
Huga.

03:09.420 --> 03:12.150
Oh, you mean Flan?

03:12.150 --> 03:14.760
What are you using all that electricity for?

03:14.760 --> 03:17.220
For her battery, isn't it obvious?

03:17.230 --> 03:20.260
She needs electricity to function.

03:20.260 --> 03:22.230
Oh, silly Flan!

03:22.230 --> 03:24.970
Try not to use so much electricity, okay?

03:24.970 --> 03:26.170
Huga?

03:26.170 --> 03:30.080
I feel like I'm forgetting something.

03:30.510 --> 03:32.210
I wonder what it is?

03:42.550 --> 03:42.750
General Hospital

03:42.750 --> 03:44.390
Of course, I remember him.

03:49.060 --> 03:54.060
He was crushed by a steel beam and was
dead by the time we got to him.

03:54.560 --> 03:56.010
Chief Sanagida

03:56.060 --> 04:00.300
But he vanished from the morgue that very night.

04:00.300 --> 04:03.310
That's the young man you're referring to, right?

04:18.220 --> 04:20.150
Well, the truth is,

04:20.160 --> 04:24.760
another middle school-aged boy
was just brought in.

04:24.760 --> 04:27.740
It seems he may be the same child.

04:29.970 --> 04:32.780
Dead Man Walking...

04:33.540 --> 04:35.710
That's him, huh?

04:36.470 --> 04:38.280
Nice shot, sir.

04:49.680 --> 04:52.760
Truly, what an unrefined laugh.

05:08.040 --> 05:11.140
Where... Where am I?

05:11.840 --> 05:13.650
A hospital?

05:17.210 --> 05:22.210
You got that? Strap him to the bed before he
wakes up so that he can't escape.

05:23.850 --> 05:28.030
He has escaped from our hospital once before.

05:29.620 --> 05:31.960
What? Strap me to the bed?!

05:31.960 --> 05:33.770
This is bad!

05:44.910 --> 05:47.840
What's this strange feeling?

05:47.840 --> 05:49.980
I have to get out of here!

05:49.980 --> 05:53.050
Where you running off to, son?

05:53.050 --> 05:54.860
Wh..Who are you?

05:56.080 --> 05:57.790
Nice to meet you.

05:57.790 --> 06:04.170
I'm Hosei Sanagida, the Chief of Medicine.

06:05.430 --> 06:08.230
I'm honored to meet you,

06:08.230 --> 06:12.240
Mr. Dead Man Walking.

06:12.430 --> 06:14.200
Dead Man?

06:14.200 --> 06:18.770
My goodness, you couldn't have forgotten.

06:18.770 --> 06:23.770
You were brought to this hotel, died,

06:25.080 --> 06:30.390
and then proceeded to escape from
the morgue in the basement.

06:32.620 --> 06:36.790
The miracle of coming back to life after dying...

06:36.790 --> 06:41.790
You're the light that has graced
the dark ages of medicine!

06:44.030 --> 06:46.830
In other words, the Messiah!

06:46.840 --> 06:51.270
So, teach me, Messiah!

06:51.270 --> 06:53.810
Teach me the mystery of resurrection!

07:06.790 --> 07:09.090
Wait!

07:09.090 --> 07:14.340
You're a patient, so you must act calmly,
like a patient!

07:18.270 --> 07:20.250
What was that?

07:21.200 --> 07:22.540
Wait!

07:22.540 --> 07:24.410
You're the hope for modern medicine!

07:24.410 --> 07:28.380
After him! Do not let him escape!

07:28.380 --> 07:33.020
He is not allowed to set foot outside this hospital!

07:35.050 --> 07:40.000
General Hospital

08:12.090 --> 08:15.160
Excuse me, please help me.

08:16.220 --> 08:18.330
What's the matter?

08:24.500 --> 08:26.870
What's going on in this hospital?

08:26.870 --> 08:31.680
A..Also, my body feels heavy again.

08:46.990 --> 08:49.820
Excuse me, the exit...

08:49.820 --> 08:52.740
Where is the exit?

09:02.970 --> 09:05.510
Once again, tonight's dinner wasn't bad.

09:05.510 --> 09:07.640
Sawawa, I'm glad to have you at my service.

09:07.640 --> 09:11.320
Yes, thank you very much, Mistress.

09:18.050 --> 09:23.160
Now that I think about it,
I know I was forgetting something before.

09:24.560 --> 09:26.430
Why is that, I wonder?

09:26.430 --> 09:28.070
Huga?

09:29.560 --> 09:32.530
Sawawa, I'm starved!

09:32.530 --> 09:34.400
I'd like some food too.

09:34.400 --> 09:37.250
Yes, coming right up.

09:39.270 --> 09:42.640
By the way, I haven't seen Hiro all day.

09:42.640 --> 09:44.980
He's running pretty late, huh?

09:44.980 --> 09:47.580
Think he's eating out somewhere tonight?

09:47.580 --> 09:51.650
Oh, that's it, I totally forgot about that.

09:51.650 --> 09:53.330
Huh? Forgot about what?

09:53.790 --> 09:58.660
It's about the time the Flame of Life
will be wearing off.

09:58.660 --> 10:03.200
See, by granting him the Flame of Life,
he becomes immortal.

10:03.200 --> 10:07.650
But the converse is, once it wears off,
he goes back to being a corpse.

10:08.340 --> 10:12.910
He's probably lying dead somewhere by now.

10:12.910 --> 10:15.840
What?! Th..That's a serious problem!

10:15.840 --> 10:17.410
We have to look for him!

10:17.410 --> 10:20.810
I know it's an inconvenience,
but can you go get him?

10:20.820 --> 10:22.800
Inconvenience, she says!

10:26.860 --> 10:30.490
Here, Liza, dinner is served.

10:30.490 --> 10:32.130
Huh?

10:45.670 --> 10:47.310
Where...

10:48.440 --> 10:50.250
This isn't it either.

10:52.280 --> 10:53.950
Did you find him?

10:53.950 --> 10:54.950
Nope.

10:54.950 --> 10:57.020
Did you check the lobby?

10:57.020 --> 10:59.000
I'm heading there now.

11:06.330 --> 11:08.240
There he is!

11:13.470 --> 11:15.540
I can't move my body.

11:18.310 --> 11:23.240
Ah, I've been looking everywhere for you,

11:23.240 --> 11:26.650
Mr. Dead Man Walking!

11:26.650 --> 11:33.660
You really cause me a lot of trouble,
you know that?

11:41.760 --> 11:45.040
And also,

11:45.400 --> 11:48.570
you seem quite tired, don't you?

11:50.340 --> 11:55.340
Now, show me the source of your infinite power!

11:57.410 --> 12:03.830
An unbelievable power that creates
life from the clutches of death!

12:07.890 --> 12:12.890
Sorry! I won't allow you to escape again.

12:13.560 --> 12:22.110
For you're too important, too essential,
to the future of modern medicine!

12:23.500 --> 12:30.750
Too important, too important a patient!

13:04.750 --> 13:09.220
What a nice night to be out for a flight.

13:20.130 --> 13:21.940
Pardon me.

13:27.670 --> 13:29.940
Heave-ho, heave-ho, heave-ho!

13:30.940 --> 13:33.940
Dead Man Walking coming through!

13:35.580 --> 13:36.180
Operating

13:38.150 --> 13:39.780
My...

13:48.820 --> 13:53.400
Yeah, his scent trails off around here.

13:55.160 --> 13:57.060
You again?!

13:57.070 --> 14:00.370
Nice to see you again, Princess.

14:00.370 --> 14:02.640
What the hell are you doing here?!

14:03.240 --> 14:06.620
Oh, taking the dog for a walk?

14:07.080 --> 14:10.650
You should at least put it on a leash.

14:12.610 --> 14:14.480
What do you want?

14:14.480 --> 14:19.480
Well, I just saw something interesting
at Sasanaki General Hospital.

14:24.290 --> 14:25.660
Oh?

14:25.660 --> 14:28.470
They are having quite the exciting event...

14:29.100 --> 14:31.080
...involving Hiro.

14:32.900 --> 14:34.130
What?!

14:34.140 --> 14:37.010
It's about to begin.

14:37.370 --> 14:39.510
You should hurry.

14:39.510 --> 14:40.640
Damn it!

14:40.640 --> 14:42.450
I'm on my way, Hiro!

14:45.310 --> 14:49.890
Oh dear, the dog ran off without its master.

15:02.200 --> 15:07.200
All right, let's begin the surgery of the century!

15:08.440 --> 15:11.740
Well, let's have a look at the patient.

15:11.740 --> 15:14.220
Wake up, wake up...

15:14.880 --> 15:17.220
Are you awake?

15:17.850 --> 15:25.530
Well then, let's unravel the mystery of our
medical miracle, Mr. Dead Man Walking.

15:26.820 --> 15:31.820
You can watch what happens to
your body while we operate!

15:34.830 --> 15:39.070
Watch closely, you don't want to miss this.

15:40.300 --> 15:44.880
You there! Is the video set to record?

15:46.510 --> 15:48.610
Okay!

15:48.610 --> 15:52.380
Then, I will begin.

15:52.380 --> 15:56.120
I'm going to  begin!

15:56.120 --> 15:59.120
And of course, you don't need any anesthetic,

15:59.120 --> 16:01.360
now do you?

16:07.330 --> 16:10.870
Hiro! I'm here to save you!

16:14.370 --> 16:17.250
Band together all you want,
you're still a bunch of weaklings!

16:17.870 --> 16:19.850
Tonight's a full moon.

16:20.540 --> 16:23.220
No one can stop me tonight!

16:24.950 --> 16:26.150
Is this it?

16:26.150 --> 16:27.790
Huga.

16:28.050 --> 16:31.690
Flandre, find where he's located.

16:31.690 --> 16:33.320
Huga.

16:37.590 --> 16:42.440
Damn, there's too many of them.
What a pain.

16:49.640 --> 16:51.280
Huga!

16:53.140 --> 16:55.140
Liza, he's in the operating room.

16:55.140 --> 16:56.780
All right!

17:04.350 --> 17:09.030
Looks like our new cadavers have arrived.

17:12.290 --> 17:14.330
Hime! It's up ahead!

17:25.610 --> 17:30.610
Tonight will go down in the
annals of medical history!

17:33.880 --> 17:38.650
We're about revolutionize medicine!

17:38.650 --> 17:42.620
Let's go get the new cadavers!

17:42.620 --> 17:47.570
My master will definitely be pleased!

17:54.440 --> 17:56.920
Wh..What's going on?

18:00.070 --> 18:01.710
Hime!

18:02.380 --> 18:04.450
You've gotta be kidding!

18:05.910 --> 18:12.920
Our electric generator shouldn't
have that much power!

18:18.260 --> 18:20.830
Flandre, maximum output.

18:20.830 --> 18:22.470
Huga!

18:24.300 --> 18:27.510
I take it you're the leader of these guys?

18:28.140 --> 18:30.470
And what if I am?

18:30.470 --> 18:32.950
What are you gonna do about it?

18:34.980 --> 18:37.050
You can reap what you've sown!

18:58.530 --> 19:03.000
Seems your master had no intentions
of taking you as his servant.

19:03.370 --> 19:05.010
Master?

19:05.570 --> 19:08.580
She did this for me?

19:14.180 --> 19:17.420
What a rare sight to behold.

19:17.420 --> 19:23.270
Not often do you see the master rushing
to save their foolish servant.

19:28.200 --> 19:34.270
I'm more intrigued by you, the man
who controls the hospital from the shadows.

19:35.970 --> 19:39.010
Lots of visitors today, huh?

19:41.210 --> 19:44.950
My name's Zeppeli,
I look forward to dealing with you

19:45.510 --> 19:48.550
Your reputation precedes you.

19:48.550 --> 19:53.590
They say you've got lousy taste,
even amongst the vampire nobility.

19:54.160 --> 19:57.490
I'm honored that you've heard of me.

19:57.490 --> 20:04.470
Truthfully, my methods are so exemplary that they
are easily misunderstood by common folk.

20:05.770 --> 20:10.770
But I'm not sure I'd call what you've done
tonight particularly commendable.

20:11.540 --> 20:15.820
Seems this town won't be boring for a while then.

20:17.310 --> 20:21.120
I'm also aware that that lovely princess is in town.

20:23.650 --> 20:26.330
You'd love a taste of her blood, wouldn't you?

20:27.360 --> 20:29.840
Aren't you after it as well?

20:31.590 --> 20:33.830
Guess you'll have to wait and see.

20:35.900 --> 20:39.540
I'm starting to take a liking to you, Ms. Reiri.

20:42.340 --> 20:44.150
Listen, Hiro.

20:46.040 --> 20:49.510
I'm going to tell you one thing
to fix your ignorance.

20:49.510 --> 20:52.080
Take it to heart.

20:54.720 --> 20:58.990
If one who has been revived by the
Flame of Life fully loses its effect,

20:58.990 --> 21:01.970
they will never be able to be
brought back to life again.

21:03.090 --> 21:07.900
You were dangerously close to losing
your life forever tonight.

21:08.800 --> 21:11.570
But it's good that you didn't, huh, Hiro?

21:12.730 --> 21:15.770
Don't make your master have to
take care of you so much.

21:17.870 --> 21:19.510
Hime...

21:19.510 --> 21:23.210
This is not a good place.
We must leave here immediately.

21:23.210 --> 21:26.850
Also, don't forget about Flandre.

21:26.850 --> 21:28.780
She used up all of her energy
in that attack before.

21:28.780 --> 21:31.530
She's lost motor function.

21:35.820 --> 21:38.130
Flandre?

21:53.810 --> 21:56.710
Hey! Come and help me!

21:56.710 --> 21:59.520
Put your back into it more, Hiro!

22:01.750 --> 22:03.390
So...

22:04.590 --> 22:07.290
She's my master?

22:12.960 --> 22:17.960
Get down on your knees and lick my red nails

22:18.530 --> 22:26.470
Call me queen with your entangled tongue

22:29.040 --> 22:31.810
The sun that blooms in Hell

22:31.810 --> 22:34.550
Darkness that's fallen to Paradise

22:34.550 --> 22:37.120
If you're confronted with light and despair

22:37.120 --> 22:39.750
Which one goes deeper?

22:39.750 --> 22:42.490
Roses fly from my head

22:42.490 --> 22:45.190
I'll scatter them into Nirvana

22:45.190 --> 22:47.790
Wounds that secretly pain you

22:47.800 --> 22:50.370
Blood that gushes away

22:50.430 --> 22:53.070
They both lead to the depths of my heart

22:53.070 --> 22:55.740
You've given these gorgeous gifts as tribute

22:55.740 --> 22:58.400
And yet you're still

22:58.410 --> 23:01.110
Seeking love?

23:01.110 --> 23:03.840
Tell me exactly to what extent

23:03.840 --> 23:06.510
Grown men are just foolish little boys?

23:06.510 --> 23:11.510
Get down on your knees and lick my sacred feet

23:11.790 --> 23:16.790
Call me queen in your hoarse voice

23:17.220 --> 23:22.220
The proof of your life creeps up the tower of pain

23:22.460 --> 23:25.160
Slowly making your way, you can barely breathe

23:25.170 --> 23:27.800
But if you still ask for it

23:27.800 --> 23:31.770
Your dying breath just might be

23:31.770 --> 23:40.060
The words that melt my frozen tears

23:41.150 --> 23:42.150
Huga.

23:42.150 --> 23:44.350
Hey, Hiro, what happened with it?

23:44.350 --> 23:45.950
Hime, what's "it"?

23:45.950 --> 23:49.060
"It" is "it", that's all there is to it.

23:49.060 --> 23:52.230
You don't know what "it" is,
and you call yourself my servant?

23:52.230 --> 23:54.490
I can't believe you don't understand
something I said.

23:54.500 --> 23:55.630
Even so...

23:55.630 --> 23:56.630
Huga!

23:56.630 --> 23:58.200
What? It's coming?

23:58.200 --> 23:59.200
It?

23:59.200 --> 24:01.130
I told you, "it" means "it".

24:01.140 --> 24:02.940
Let's see...

24:03.100 --> 24:05.240
Next episode, "Princess Locked Room"

24:05.240 --> 24:07.170
Look, Hiro, that's it.

24:07.170 --> 24:07.570
That's "it"?

24:08.880 --> 24:10.290
Huga, huga.
